  "title": "Chicken Breasts with Herb Basting Sauce",
  "description": "Bone-in chicken breasts are roasted with a delicious olive oil, garlic, and mixed herb basting sauce until juicy and tender.",
  "authors": [
    "CHRISTYJ"
